            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Angina pectoris is one of the most important manifestation of coronary artery disease. In this review, the Ischemic Cardiopathy and Coronary Units Group defines the Spanish Society of Cardiology policy concerning angina pectoris definition and classification.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
